# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=spirv-headers
_lockname=spirv-headers
pkgver=1.4.313.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="SPIR-V (the GPU shader format) headers"
arch=(any)
url="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Headers"
license=(MIT)
source=("https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Headers/archive/vulkan-sdk-$pkgver/SPIRV-Headers-vulkan-sdk-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('PIN')

build() {
    cmake -S SPIRV-Headers-vulkan-sdk-$pkgver -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
